        "content": "## Approve by label to send\n\nApply the send-approved label to a thread in Gmail. Within a minute this flow matches it to the pending reply, sends it in the thread, marks the row sent, deletes the leftover draft, and removes the approval label so the next reply in that thread waits for a fresh approval. Only rows with status pending are ever eligible, so nothing can send twice."
